{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil forces swarm and threaten to destroy all of time. A small jumping spider must swing into action to save the past, present and future from multiversal invasion! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing through levels, string together enemies, and fling yourself through time!</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use webs to swing around levels at breakneck speed! Dodge armoured enemies and expose their weakpoints to attack.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/cafc58b34e169bdd3ab26cb74c3963e4.poster.avif?t=1759958600\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/cafc58b34e169bdd3ab26cb74c3963e4.webm?t=1759958600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/cafc58b34e169bdd3ab26cb74c3963e4.mp4?t=1759958600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot webs to string together enemies for combo attacks. You can even manipulate the environment, flinging objects and turning hazards into deadly traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/aae9c80664c4c8d449d40650df4f4ac9.poster.avif?t=1759958600\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/aae9c80664c4c8d449d40650df4f4ac9.webm?t=1759958600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/aae9c80664c4c8d449d40650df4f4ac9.mp4?t=1759958600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the fast, fluid swinging and build up speed to become an unstoppable whirlwind of attacks, weaving through enemies and stringing them together for combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather items across time</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items from the past, present, and future, each with their own effects and synergies! Tailor your build to harness the power of space-age technology, the forces of primal evolution, or paradoxical fusions of both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/dbbcabf1a01b63ac69fccd20ee2014c6.poster.avif?t=1759958600\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/dbbcabf1a01b63ac69fccd20ee2014c6.webm?t=1759958600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/dbbcabf1a01b63ac69fccd20ee2014c6.mp4?t=1759958600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the past, present, and future</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against both prehistoric and robotic foes to defend the timeline from attack by time-spanning forces. Lead by the dubious Time Snail, join the Time Rogues in their mission to close the Time Portals and save the timeline!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018720?t=1759958600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018720?t=1759958600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/b31562006908fb5982d082ff70cc65c9f729c9e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759958600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s